---
import StorefrontLayout from '../../layouts/Storefront.astro';
---
<StorefrontLayout title="Terms of Service">
  <div class="bg-[#0b1516] min-h-screen py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tighter mb-4">Terms of Service.</h1>
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-[#36f4a4] uppercase tracking-widest">Last Updated: October 15, 2025</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12 text-[#dae5e6]/70 font-light leading-relaxed">
        
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2">1. The Symeno Model & Agreement</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">By accessing or using the Symeno LLC ("Symeno", "we", "us") website, you agree to be bound by these Terms. Symeno operates a high-volume retail arbitrage model. We source authentic goods from authorized distributors globally to offer compressed margins to the end consumer. We do not manufacture these products.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2">2. Pricing & Algorithmic Errors</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">Our pricing is dynamically updated based on global wholesale data. While we strive for absolute accuracy, our algorithms are managed by humans, and errors can occur. If a product is listed at an incorrect price due to a typographical or systematic error, we reserve the right to refuse or cancel any orders placed for that product, regardless of whether the order has been confirmed and your credit card charged. If your card has been charged, a full refund will be issued immediately.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2">3. Intellectual Property & Authenticity</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">All products sold on Symeno are 100% authentic and acquired through legally verified supply chains. However, all brand names, logos, and trademarks (e.g., Apple, Sony, Dyson) are the property of their respective owners. Symeno makes no claim of ownership over these third-party trademarks and uses them solely under the doctrine of nominal fair use to identify the products being sold.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2">4. Fraud Prevention & Order Limits</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">To maintain our pricing model and prevent unauthorized reselling of our inventory, Symeno reserves the right to limit the quantity of items purchased per person, per household, or per order. We actively monitor for fraudulent activity using strict heuristic models. Any order flagged by our security perimeter will be automatically canceled without notice.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</StorefrontLayout>
